        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kabūlagīlwe ka nkīma kūhayiwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baisilaeli bibilinga Mispa pye a bose; biza pye mu būsangī bumò, kūfuma Dani kūshisha Beeli-sheba, nū kūfuma ū kū sī ya Gileadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A batongeeji ba ng'anda ja Baisilaeli ī jose būlī ng'wene wīmīīla hipandī lyakwe ū mu kwibilinga kwa banhū ba ng'wa Mulungu; baalī bashilikale shihūmbī magana anè na makūmi ataano, baakoolī ba kūlwīīla shū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(A banhū ba lūganda lwa Benjamini bigwa ī gīkī a Baisilaeli bajaga Mispa.) Hūna a Baisilaeli būbawīla, “Bing'we tūwīlagi ūmo yajīlile nose mhayo gwamalofu gīkī gwilonga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Nnawī ū ngoshi wa nkīma ūyo walī wabūlagwa ūhaya, “Naalī mu lūgendo nū nke wane; aho nashika Gibea ya mu sī ya banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Benjamini nūūbona nalaale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu būjikū a banhū ba Gibea biza bīpīndya ī numba, baalī na ng'hūmbū ja kūnibūlaga ū nene; hūna būng'wiguusīja ū nke wane kūshisha ūcha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū nūnsola ū nke wane nūmutagūla mapingili mapingili; nūūtwaala ipingili līmò līmò hose pye ū mu sī ja wingīji wa Baisilaeli, nguno bīītile mhayo gwabūbi na gwamalofu ū mu Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū Baisilaeli īkī pye mulīho aha, gūhooyelagi mufunye ū būlamuji wing'we.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye a banhū ūmo baalī bagelelile bīīmīīla, būhaya gīkī, “Atīho nūūlū ūmò wise ū wa kūshoka kwiheema; nūūlū atizilonga munhū ose ose wa kūja kū ng'wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo gwa kwīyīītīla ī Gibea gūlī gīkī, tūkwīdumīla wa ndīīma ja kūsolwa wa kūtūlīja mbale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tūkūyūsola banhū ikūmi kūfuma mu būlī igana lya banhū ba ng'anda jose ja Baisilaeli; hama ū kūfuma ū mu banhū shihūmbī, tūkūsola mo igana līmò; ū mu banhū shihūmbī ikūmi ū ng'weene tūkūsola banhū shihūmbī shimò. A benabo bakūbiza batwaji ba shilīwa na shiigunaanīlo shingī ū kū bashilikale. A bashilikale ūlū balashike ī Gibea ū kū banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Benjamini, bakūbinha īyo ībiigeleelilwe kūlwa mhayo gwamalofu ūyo baagwītile mu sī ya Isilaeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū pye gete a Baisilaeli a bagosha bibilinga mu būsangī būmò kwilwisha nū nzengo gwenūyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lūganda lo Benjamini kwilwīlīīla",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ng'anda ja Baisilaeli jūūtūma banhū hose pyī ū mu sī ya banhū ba lūganda lwa Benjamini būja bakūhayaga, “Ni yajile kinehe nose mhayo gwamalofu gīkī gwītwa ū mu bing'we? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, bafunyagi a banhū ba nhūngwa ja būbi gīko, abo balī ū mu Gibea tūbabūlage, tūwīnje ū būbi wenūbū ū mu Baisilaeli.” Alīyo a banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Benjamini batabadegelekile a badūgū babo a Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bikobya dūhū nabo kūfuma hose pyī ū mu mizengo yabo, biza bibilingīla Gibea kwilwisha būlūgū na a Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Benjamini bitana bashilikale kūfuma ū mu mizengo yabo, ū lūshikū lwenūlo bigela shihūmbī makūmi abīlī na shitandatū; bamani ba kūlwīīla shū, kūleka kūbabala abo magana mpungatī a ba mu nzengo gwa Gibea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu bashilikale benabo baalīmo bagosha basolwa magana mpungatī ba lūmoso, būlī ng'wene walī ndeeba no, atūūfuuja shikolo shose shose, nūūlū lūkabiza lūywīīlī lūmò ūlū ūlūluuta iwe bo kūtūmamīla lūtaago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baisilaeli abo bakikuminga, kūleka kūbabala a ba lūganda lwa Benjamini, baalī bagosha shihūmbī magana anè, pye banhū ba būlūgū, bamani ba kūlwīīla shū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū a Baisilaeli būja Beeseli",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20:18",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Beeseli:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, numba ya ng'wa SEEBA.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kūbūūja kūlī SEEBA. Būūhaya gīkī, “Ūmo tūlī ng'wenūmu, nani atonge ū kūja kwilwisha na a banhū ba lūganda lwa Benjamini?” Ū SEEBA ūhaya, “Yuda ni atongage ū kūja.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha ntondo yaho, a Baisilaeli būmisha dilū, beegeela ī Gibea būūkakoma ng'hambī yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a Baisilaeli būbasanga ī Gibea a banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Benjamini, bamba būlūgū kwilwisha nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banbū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Benjamini aho baapuluka ū mu nzengo gwa Gibea, būbahūlūla Baisilaeli shihūmbī makūmi abīlī na shibīlī ū lūshikū lwenūlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a Baisilaeli bitimbya ng'holò, gīkī balaaje hangī ū kwipandī lyenīlo īlo baalī ū lūshikū lwa kwandya, bakambe hangī ū būlūgū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike a Baisilaeli būja kūnīlīīla ū SEEBA taame; būnīlīīla na kūmūūja balīhaya, “Tūje hangī ū kū būlūgū tūkilwishe na a badūgū bise a banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Benjamini?” Nang'hwe ū SEEBA ūbawīla, “Jagi ko mukalwe nabo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana nū mu lūshikū lwa kabīlī lwaho a Baisilaeli beegeela ko kwamba būlūgū, gīkī balwe na a banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Benjamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūkangala lwenūlū a banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Benjamini aho baafuma ū mu Gibea gīkī bilwishe nabo, būbabūlaga Baisilaeli shihūmbī ikūmi na shinaane, bose bamani baakūlwīīla shū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna pyī ī libità lya bashilikale ba Baisilaeli būlinha bajile Beeseli; būshika bigaasha kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA bakūlīlaga. Ū lūshikū lwenūūlo būfunga, būfunya na shitambò sha kūpemva hamò na shakwinha sha būsangī kūlwa nguno ya ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma būmūūja a Baisilaeli ū SEEBA, (ū mu shikū jenījo ī lisandīko lya būlagane bo ng'wa SEEBA lyalī kwenūko; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nū Finehasi ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Elieza, ng'witūnja o ng'wa Alooni, wikalaga kwenūko akūtūmamaga kū būtongi walyo.) Na lūūlū būbūūja balīhaya gīkī, “Tūje hangī ū kwilwisha būlūgū na a badūgū bise a banhū ba lūganda lwa Benjamini, nūūlū hamo tooye lūūlū?” Ū SEEBA ūbawīla, “Jaagi nguno ī ntondo nakūbatūūla mu makono ging'we.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lūganda lo Benjamini kūmalwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a Baisilaeli būsola banhū ba kwibanda mu masaka kūgūpīndīlīja ū nzengo gwa Gibea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu lūshikū lwa kadatū lwaho būja hangī ū kūbadumīla a banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Benjamini; bamba ū būlūgū kwilwisha nū nzengo gwa Gibea gīt'ūmo bīītīlaga na kale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Benjamini būdutwa kūgūsegenela ū nzengo. Bandya kūbatūla na kūbabūlaga bamò ba banhū aho bakūpeelaga ū mu matogolo nū mu makūūwa; līmò lya makūūwa genayo lyaalī ya kūja Beeseli, līngī Gibea; būbūlaga Baisilaeli ba kūshika gītī makūmi adatū gīko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Benjamini būyiwīla gīkī, “Nī lelo twabapyena gīt'ūmo tūkwītīlaga na kale.” Alīyo a Baisilaeli biwīlaga gīkī, “Tūbapeelagi tūbadute kūja kū makūūwa bagūsegenele ū nzengo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye a Baisilaeli bīnga ū mu mapandī gabo ūmo baalī bihela, būja būūkashika Baali-tamali; hūna a bibandīīji būpuluka ū mu masaka ayo baalī bibanda, ū kwiza kūgūdumīla ū nzengo gwa Gibea būgūfumīīla mu ng'weli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Banhū shihūmbī ikūmi ba būdūla mu kalwīīle ka būlūgū ū mu Baisilaeli, būgūsanga ū nzengo gwa Gibea kwilwisha nago būlūgū. Ū būlūgū wenūbo būkabiza wa kalwīīle kabūbi no; alīyo a banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Benjamini baalī batīdeebaga ī mibi īyo yaalī hihī kūbilongela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūbapyena a banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Benjamini ū kū būtongi wa Baisilaeli; ū lūshikū lwenūlo a Baisilaeli būbūlaga banhū shihūmbī makūmi abīlī na shitaano na igana līmò, ū kūfuma ū mu banhū ba lūganda lwa Benjamini; bose baalī banhū ba kūlwīīla shū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Benjamini būbona hape gīkī baaheewa. A Baisilaeli bakandya kūbapeela a banhū ba lūgūnda lwa ng'wa Benjamini, nguno baalī bamanile gīkī balīho bibandīīji abo baalī baabatūūla hihī nū nzengo gwa Gibea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana a banhū abo baalī bibanda bakīīta kaja kaja, būpeela kūja ū mu nzengo gwa Gibea, būshika būgūsaambaalīla wangū wangū, būbamala shū pye a banhū ba mu nzengo gwenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baisilaeli baalī baagūsha na a bibandīīji gīkī balaagūpembe ū nzengo gūdundumūke lyochi itaale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a Baisilaeli ūlū būbona gīko bakūgalūka bandye būlūgū. Ū ng'wikanza lyenīlo a banhū ba lūganda lwa Benjamini bilembaga balīhaya, “Nī lelo twabapyena gīt'ūmo twalīītīlaga ū mu kalwīīle a ka shikū ījo jaabītile;” na ng'hana būbatūla na kūbabūlaga Baisilaeli (ba kūshika gītī makūmi adatū.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī lyochi lya kūfuma ū mu nzengo aho lyadundumūka, a banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Benjamini bahayūgalūka, būgūbona ū nzengo ū gose gūkūdundumūkaga lyochi lījile kwigūlya kwilunde. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hū a henaho a Baisilaeli būbagalūkīla; a banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Benjamini bakogoha no, nguno bakabona gīkī yababipīla ī mihayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bandya kūbapeela a Baisilaeli bajile kwitogolo; alīyo batabūshigile ū būlūgū. A Baisilaeli abo baafumaga ū mu mizengo būbakūūbya būja bakūbabūlagaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būūbanyamanīja ha gatī a banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Benjamini būbapeeja, būbapandīkīla bbihī dūhū; kīya ya Gibea, būbabūlagīla henaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būūgwa banhū shihūmbī ikūmi na shinaane ba mu lūganda lwa ng'wa Benjamini; bose bamani ba kūlwa mu būlūgū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho baagalūka gīkī bapeele kūja kwitogolo bakapīlīle kwiwe lya Limoni, a Baisilaeli būbabūlaga shihūmbī shitanò aho balī ū mu makūūwa ga nzīla. Bongeja kūbakūūbya kūja Gidomu, būbabūlaga hangī bangī shihūmbī shibīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū lūshikū lwenūlo būbiza baashila banhū shihūmbī makūmi abīlī na shitaano ū mu lūganda lwa ng'wa Benjamini; a bose bamani ba mihayo ya būlūgū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo banhū magana atandatū būnyamuka; būpeelela kwitogolo, būūkapīlīla kwiwe lya Limoni; bikala kwenūko myeji īnè. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baisilaeli būshoka ū kū sī ya banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Benjamini, būūkabamala shū pye a banhū nī mitugo, na būlī shose shose īsho baashibonaga. Nī minzengo ī yose īyo bīībonaga bīīpemba moto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.48"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
